-- Seeds 10 time-limited (29-day) product keys, generated by
-- scripts/generate-timed-keys.js. Run once, after schema.sql (which must already
-- have the duration_days/expires_at columns), in Supabase's SQL Editor. Safe to
-- re-run: "on conflict do nothing" skips hashes already present instead of erroring.
-- Each key's access window starts the moment it's first activated, not now.

on conflict (key_hash) do nothing;
